/-!
Exact inventory of the original-bound Prop producers and explicit residual
reduction, selected-redex coherence, and fixed admitted-completion boundaries.
Every private and compiler-generated module entry is retained, including
repeated entries when Lean records the same declaration in several modules.
Only propext and Quot.sound are allowed.
closure_claim = 0; scope_closure_claim = 0.
-/
set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxRecDepth 8192
namespace Rcic.F3.AOriginalPropSeal
open Lean Elab Command

